#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SE9702 expect=skipped domain=TX
# Rule:Description: FDA-SE9702 — the Required key SETCD is not populated.
#note "SETCD is absent from TX, so Requirements.Variables.All gates the rule to SKIPPED rather than firing on every row. This is the absent-column guard the standing 'absent column = all-missing column' policy makes necessary: without it empty(SETCD) would be true on every row of every dataset that simply lacks the column. Asserts the SKIP, not merely the absence of a finding."
#library standard=sendig version=3-1-1
dataset TX
col STUDYID type=Char
col DOMAIN type=Char
col TXSEQ type=Char
col TXPARMCD type=Char
col TXPARM type=Char
col TXVAL type=Char
---
S1      | TX     | 1     | TRTDOS   | Treatment Dose | 10
---
